<title>USA: Commercial Net Lease Realty in offering.</title>
<headline>Commercial Net Lease Realty in offering.</headline>
<dateline>ORLANDO, Fla. 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Commercial Net Lease Realty Inc said on Thurday it will offer 2.3 million common-stock shares to the public priced at $15.125 per share, and will use the proceeds to pay down debt.</p>
<p>The underwriters are Smith Barney Inc and Robinson-Humphrey Co Inc.</p>
<p>Commercial, an equity real-estate investment trust, owns 196 properties in 31 states.</p>
<p>	  ((-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610))</p>
</text>
